    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reinstate the death penalty for child murderers",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "There is no room in society for child murderers. We call on the Government to introduce legislation to reintroduce the death penalty for those convicted of the deliberate murder of a child.",
